{
  "_comment": [
    "The spelling pool. Hand-curated, read-only to the server, and the reason",
    "this feature costs nothing per day: five words are drawn from here, never",
    "generated.",
    "",
    "`tier` names an entry in [spelling.anchors] in config.toml — that is where",
    "difficulty becomes a rating, and it is config so the scale cannot drift.",
    "`hint` is spoken-word disambiguation, not a vocabulary test: you are being",
    "asked to spell a word you already know, and 'principle' and 'principal'",
    "sound identical. Every entry needs one for that reason, homophone or not —",
    "a bee where you have to guess which word was meant is measuring hearing.",
    "",
    "Add words freely. The draw prefers ones you have never seen, then ones you",
    "have missed, then whatever is least recent, so a longer pool simply means",
    "longer before anything comes round again."
  ],
